Show Manipulators
To change the length of the graphic and the anchor points of the object, click Show Manipulators 
on the Edit ribbon tab or press M on the keyboard.
The manipulator at the start and at the end of the length-oriented object is cut off. When you attach an
object of the same type to the other object, the two combined halves result in a complete manipulator
again. When you move the mouse over a manipulator, Plant Simulation shows a Tooltip.
