Capacity [text box] - Conveyor
Type the Capacity of the Conveyor into the text box.
Remarks
The Capacity is the maximum number of MUs that can be located on the Conveyor as a whole or in part at
any one time.
The default value -1 designates an infinite capacity.
You can also type in another number, so that the Conveyor does not make use of the entire available
Length.
