Automatic Stop [check box] - Conveyor
To set the Current Speed of the Conveyor to 0 when it does not transport a MU, select this check box. This
might, for example, be the case if it is empty or if it is blocked if a MU cannot leave it.
Remarks
If you select Automatic Stop, Plant Simulation immediately sets the Speed to 0 without using the value
you typed in for the Deceleration. Along the same lines the Speed is immediately set to the Target Speed
without using the value you typed in for the Acceleration.
When the Speed of the Conveyor is 0, the Energy State changes to Operational.
